    "Recurrence: !n = (n-1)(!(n-1) + !(n-2)), with !1 = 0, !2 = 1.",
    "Values: !3 = 2, !4 = 9, !5 = 44, !6 = 265.",
    "!n is the nearest integer to n!/e.",
    "Repeated letters break the formula - do a case analysis instead."
