    "why": "The order decides whether y may depend on x. Swapping a universal and an existential changes the claim from 'a matching column exists' to 'every row has a matching entry'.",
    "counterexample": "Domain {1, 2}, R = {(1, 2), (2, 1)}. For all x there exists y R(x, y) is true; there exists y for all x R(x, y) is false."
