     "answer": "Yes. LHL = 2(3) + 1 = 7, RHL = 3(3) - 2 = 7, and f(3) = 7.",
     "why": "The smallest version of the GATE shape: two linear pieces that happen to meet. Change one coefficient and the same computation produces a jump."
