     "why": "C(10,3) = 120, and 120 x 0.064 x 0.02799 = 0.2150. The mean is np = 4 and the variance np(1-p) = 2.4, so the standard deviation is 1.549 - which is the quantity GATE asked for in 2024 Set 2 Q.8."
